5,1,1,talk,May,,"Since we're finally deciding on the room, I want some actual data. I'll look into the fortnight's tally of use by person and the final clear-out of the old fridge.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I'll check the partition wall to the office and the crumbs and bins at the desks. I want to see how the current usage affects the main workspace.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Servas,,I believe we should be mindful of the time and effort spent on maintenance. I will look into the invoices for outside hire by the hour and the facilities callouts on this floor.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I want to know about the money! I'll check the quotes for the two fit-outs and the invoices for outside hire by the hour. Let's see what we're actually spending!,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I want to know how we're actually interacting. I'll look into the unplanned talk since the refit and where the last awkward conversation happened. We need a space that actually helps us talk!,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,May,,"@Sakura, you and Servas are both looking at the invoices. Maybe we should coordinate so we don't overlap too much? Or is it better if we all see the numbers for ourselves?","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Misaki,,It doesn't matter if we overlap. It's better that we each see the data directly so there are no misunderstandings when we discuss the options later.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Servas,,I agree with Misaki. Direct observation prevents the distortion of truth. It is better to have multiple witnesses to the facts than to rely on a single interpretation.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"Exactly! Plus, it's like a little game to see if we find the same things! I'm super excited to see those quotes and find out how much everything costs!","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Kenji,,I agree! It's better if we all have our own pieces of the puzzle. I'm really curious to see if the way we're talking to each other is as bad as I think it is.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,May,,"Fair enough. Since we're all on the same page about the data, I'm satisfied. I'll stick with my choices and see who's actually been hogging the room and who's been cleaning up.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I'll stick with my choices as well. Understanding the physical impact on our desks and the sound leakage will be essential for making a practical decision.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Servas,,I shall remain with my selections. Understanding the hidden costs of our time and the frequency of maintenance requests will provide the necessary perspective to ensure our decision is sustainable.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Sakura,,Me too! I'm sticking with the quotes and the invoices. I can't wait to see the numbers! It's going to be like a treasure hunt for the truth!,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I'm sticking with mine too. I really want to know if we've lost our chance to just chat or have those tough talks. Let's see what we find!,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,May,,I think we've all made our choices. Let's get the information and see what we're actually dealing with. I'm looking forward to seeing if my suspicions about the room's usage are correct.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I agree. Let's proceed and see what the data reveals. I'll be interested to see if the physical evidence matches the complaints I've heard.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Servas,,Indeed. Let us move forward with a clear mind. I look forward to seeing how these details illuminate the path toward a balanced and sustainable solution for everyone.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Sakura,,"Yay! I'm all set! I'll go hunting for those numbers right now! I hope they aren't too scary, but knowing the truth is the best part! Let's go, let's go!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Kenji,,I'm ready too! I hope the information shows that we really need a place to connect. Let's see what the data tells us and figure this out together!,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
