60,3,1,talk,May,,"Looking at the options, a Meeting Space seems the most professional. It has a calendar to prevent the hogging I saw in the data, and it avoids the maintenance nightmare of a kitchen.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Misaki,,"I agree. A Meeting Space is the most practical choice. It provides a structured environment that minimizes the chaos and noise issues I'm concerned about, unlike the Open Kitchen which would likely increase them.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Servas,,"A Meeting Space aligns with the need for sustainability. It eliminates the recurring cost of external rentals and avoids the uncoordinated labor of a kitchen, ensuring that no one person is burdened with the upkeep.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Sakura,,"I'm voting for the Meeting Space too! It stops us from wasting money on those outside rooms, and the calendar makes it fair. It's the best way to save and be organized!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Kenji,,I'm all in for the Meeting Space! It gives us a private spot for those tough conversations and helps us actually get to know each other. It's the perfect solution for everyone. I vote C!,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,May,,It seems we've reached a rare moment of total agreement. I'm happy to support a choice that brings structure to the room's use. I vote for Option C.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Misaki,,I agree. It is the only option that addresses the noise and mess issues while providing a clear system for use. I vote for Option C.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Servas,,"When the path is clear and the consensus is unanimous, there is no need for further hesitation. For the sake of our time and our harmony, I vote for Option C.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Sakura,,I'm so happy we all agree! It's like we solved a big puzzle together! I'm voting for Option C too! Yay for the Meeting Space!,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Kenji,,I'm so glad we're all on the same page! This is going to make such a difference for us as a team. I officially vote for Option C!,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
